{"version":1,"content":"<p>據最新供應鏈消息，蘋果計劃在下一代iPhone 18系列中提升電池容量，這意味着未來機型有望在續航表現方面實現進一步增強。雖然蘋果近年來持續通過晶片能效提升來延長設備使用時間，但最新傳聞顯示，公司可能準備重新將重點放在更大容量電池上。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584898.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:21:14.695926+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T16:03:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:19.958575+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:19.958575+00:00","content_hash":"71ca9adb8af12e0c7ddf02f065a8dd6aff87dd9de4c9bef5db61dc9f58e75b40","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}